<h2 class="color-light-blue roboto mt-5 text-center">WHY WE WILL NEVER</h2>
<h1 class="color-blue roboto text-center">GO BACK ON OUR PROMISE</h1>
<p class="roboto color-blue text-center p-2" style="font-size:20px">We are able to raise our chickens without antibiotics, because we raise them humanely. Our chickens are active, live in clean environments, have places to perch and space to play and eat an all-vegetarian diet. </p>
<p class="text-center"><img src="/images/content/no-antibiotics-ever-products-risks-of-use.jpg" width="100%"></p></div></div>
<div class="row justify-content-center">
<div class="col-md-4 p-3">
<h2 class="color-light-blue roboto mt-5 text-center">Risks of Antibiotics Use in Poultry Care:</h2>
<ul class="roboto color-blue h3 mb-5">
<li>Over time, unnecessary use of antibiotics can cause bacteria to be resistant to the antibiotics given.</li>
<li>Antibiotic-resistant bacteria can enter our water systems. </li>
<li>We don’t want that in the food that we feed our families, our children and our grandchildren.</li></ul></div></div></div>
